  "reading": "とる",
  "romaji": "toru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to record (audio or video)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to record; to tape (audio or video)",
      "explanation": "To capture sound or moving images, especially a TV program, onto a recording device or medium."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "27731_toru_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦テレビ→テレビ：01536_terebi⟧⟦{番組|ばんぐみ}→番組：01705_bangumi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{録|と}る。",
      "english": "To record a TV program.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27731_toru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{見|み}られない→見る：00283_miru⟧⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦ドラマ→ドラマ：03867_dorama⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧{録|と}っておく。",
      "english": "I record dramas that air at times I can't watch.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27731_toru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{好|す}き→好き：02355_suki⟧な⟦{歌手|かしゅ}→歌手：00197_kashu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{音楽|おんがく}→音楽：00661_ongaku⟧⟦{番組|ばんぐみ}→番組：01705_bangumi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{毎週|まいしゅう}→毎週：00730_maishuu⟧{録|と}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧。",
      "english": "I record my favorite singer's music program every week.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A specialized writing of とる used when the meaning is 'to record' audio or video. The plain ⟦{取|と}る→取る：00565_toru⟧ is the general-purpose verb; {録|と}る narrows it specifically to recording.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{番組|ばんぐみ}→番組：01705_bangumi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{録|と}る: to record a program\n- {録|と}っておく: to record (for later)\n- ⟦ビデオ→ビデオ：01499_bideo⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{録|と}る: to record onto video\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{撮|と}る→撮る：00760_toru⟧: to take (a photo); to film — used for photographs and shooting footage\n- ⟦{録音|ろくおん}する→録音する：25388_rokuonsuru⟧: to record sound — a more formal ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb, specifically for audio\n- ⟦{録画|ろくが}→録画：04441_rokuga⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to record video — the formal ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb for video; more common in writing than {録|と}る",
